      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement\n\n1. start chat (1:1 vs Group chat participant)\n2. send/receive message (chat)\n3. send/receive media\n4. delete messages\n5. Message state - sent/read\n5. Presence (Online/Offline): This is a heavy-duty requirement.\n Tracking millions of persistent socket connections to show a \"green dot\" or \"Last Seen\" \nis a massive scaling challenge.\n---\nNFR:\n1. Availability: whatsapp must be up always (5 nine) \n            : robust infra, redundancy, failover and quick recovery (monitoring)\n2. Latency: No perceivable delay (esp when no network partition has happened. \n      - In case of n/w failure, eventual consistency =>\n3. Security = cross cutting concerns. E2E\n4. Scalability = related to availability as well. In order to be highly available, or to serve con\ncurrent request - servers, database must scale (auto scaling based on metrics, load).\n5 Durability - sent message must be received. storage on server only till not delivered (max 30 days)\n6. Maintainability = for data back up etc must not cause downtime  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 518,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement\n\n1. start chat (1:1 vs Group chat participant)\n2. send/receive message (chat)\n3. send/receive media\n4. delete messages\n5. Message state - sent/read\n5. Presence (Online/Offline): This is a heavy-duty requirement.\n Tracking millions of persistent socket connections to show a \"green dot\" or \"Last Seen\" \nis a massive scaling challenge.\n---\nNFR:\n1. Availability: whatsapp must be up always (5 nine) \n            : robust infra, redundancy, failover and quick recovery (monitoring)\n2. Latency: No perceivable delay (esp when no network partition has happened. \n      - In case of n/w failure, eventual consistency =>\n3. Security = cross cutting concerns. E2E\n4. Scalability = related to availability as well. In order to be highly available, or to serve con\ncurrent request - servers, database must scale (auto scaling based on metrics, load).\n5 Durability - sent message must be received. storage on server only till not delivered (max 30 days)\n6. Maintainability = for data back up etc must not cause downtime  ",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
